# root .gitignore
backend/.env
tracking-snippet/node_modules/
backend/node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store

# =====================================================================
# Internal-only documentation and process artifacts — excluded so this
# repo can be made public or shared externally without exposing dev
# history, per-client integration details, or session-scoped debugging
# aids. README.md at repo root is DELIBERATELY NOT covered by any rule
# below — it is the project's public-facing overview and must stay
# visible. Reviewed 2026-07-25; keep this list itemized (no blanket
# `*.md` or similar) so every exclusion is a deliberate, visible decision.
# =====================================================================

# Dated dev history/handoff (CHANGELOG, TODO, SESSION_HANDOFF, and any
# other internal doc placed in docs/ — e.g. shopify-integration-log.md).
# Still maintained locally per the Docs convention in README.md; this
# folder is process history, not public-facing documentation.
docs/

# Ad-hoc verification scripts (Puppeteer/manual, session-specific
# debugging aids referencing internal decisions) — not a real test suite.
frontend/test/
tracking-snippet/test/
backend/test/

# Manual test-plan / QA runbooks — internal process notes, not
# public-facing docs.
backend/TESTING.md
tracking-snippet/TESTING.md

# Per-client Shopify integration notes (real client name, real theme file
# names, store-specific gotchas) — client-identifying detail that has no
# reason to be in a public repo.
tracking-snippet/shopify-integration.md
tracking-snippet/shopify-webhook-integration.md

# =====================================================================
# Proprietary source — this repo is public, and none of the following
# should be reconstructable from it: the database schema/RLS design, the
# backend's actual business logic, or any client integration code/config.
# NOTE: this only stops NEW files under these paths from being tracked —
# anything already committed stays in git history until it is separately
# untracked (git rm --cached) or history is rewritten. Reviewed 2026-07-30.
# =====================================================================

# Schema, RLS policies, Postgres functions, seed/verification data — this
# is the architectural blueprint of the whole system.
supabase/

# Backend business logic: ingestion, identity-resolution, and every
# per-platform integration (Shopify, and any future WooCommerce/other).
backend/src/modules/

# Any future integration-specific code or config, at any depth (e.g. a
# woocommerce/, integrations/, or platform-specific connector folder).
**/integrations/
**/integration/

# One-off or maintenance scripts, at any depth — operational detail with
# no reason to be publicly readable.
**/scripts/
